OL,4,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GAn Epiphany Carol Service from St
OL,6,     GLuke's, Chelsea, London, with
OL,7,     Gmusic by Sheppard, Clemens,
OL,8,     GCrotch, Morten Lauridsen, Philip
OL,9,     GStopford, John Rutter and
OL,10,     GBruckner.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Copland
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod follows Copland's
OL,13,     Gquest for a music that speaks of
OL,14,     GAmerica.
OL,15,G1700FIn Tune
OL,16,     GChinese pipa virtuoso and
OL,17,     Gcomposer Gao Hong joins Katie
OL,18,     GDerham to play live music from
OL,19,     Gher new album.
OL,20,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,21,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,22,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
