OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 7 JAN
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GThe London-based Afro-Latin jazz
OL,12,     Gensemble COLECTIVA are back with
OL,13,     Gnew music.
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GTenors Levy Sekgapane and
OL,16,     GLawrence Brownlee share the stage
OL,17,     Gin this opera extravaganza,
OL,18,     Gsinging arias by Rossini,
OL,19,     GDonizetti, Bellini among others.
